{"id":"68bc51f7b76b9d84","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Stem Extension","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension — ZFC Forcing10 Stem Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension — ZFC Forcing10 Stem Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension — ZFC Forcing10 Stem Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,p,P,\\operatorname{trunk} \\in V\">\\(q,p,P,\\operatorname{trunk} \\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{trunk}))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{trunk}))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10StemExtension}_S \\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10StemExtension}_S \\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}stem\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10StemExtension}_S(q,p,P,\\leq_P,\\operatorname{trunk})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{trunk}))\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\operatorname{trunk}(q)=\\operatorname{trunk}(p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}stem\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10StemExtension}_S(q,p,P,\\leq_P,\\operatorname{trunk})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{trunk}))\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\operatorname{trunk}(q)=\\operatorname{trunk}(p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stem extension is meaningful only relative to a forcing order and a designated trunk map.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"q,p,P,\\operatorname{trunk} \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{trunk}))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10StemExtension}_S \\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}stem\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10StemExtension}_S(q,p,P,\\leq_P,\\operatorname{trunk})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{trunk}))\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\operatorname{trunk}(q)=\\operatorname{trunk}(p)","display":true}],"bytes":1143,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2020","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension.md|58-df-zfc-forcing10-stem-extension]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","36d7463d215be751"]}